        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSimplify the expression [MATH: -(2x-1.3).]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, we rewrite the negative sign as multiplication by [MATH: (-1)\\mathbin:]\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n-(2x-1.3)&=\\\n(-1)(2x-1.3)\n}]\n\nThen, we distribute the [MATH: (-1)] to each term in the parentheses, and simplify:\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(-1)(2x-1.3)&=\\\n(-1) (2x)-(-1) (1.3)&=\\\n-2x-(-1.3)&=\\\n-2x+1.3\n}]"
