        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nSimplify [MATH: \u2212 (\u2212 a + b \u2212 c).]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: a \u2212 b \u2212 c]\nb. [MATH: a \u2212 b + c]\nc. [MATH: \u2212 a \u2212 b \u2212 c]\nd. [MATH: \u2212 a + b \u2212 c]\ne. [MATH: a + b + c]"
